  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">LFA sem Interpol BiH</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">LFA-sem Interpol BiH</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Continuation of a feasibility study with Sida financing regarding the preconditions for Swedish support to the Interpol Office in Sarajevo. The actual support regards a LFA workshop to allow all involved parties to reach a unified point of view as to what should be the priorities of the Swedish support. The expected result of the seminar is a project proposal to be presented to Sida.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Uppf&#xf6;ljning av f&#xf6;rstudie av f&#xf6;ruts&#xe4;ttningarna f&#xf6;r svenskt st&#xf6;d till Interpolkontoret i Sarajevo. Aktuell insats avser genomf&#xf6;rande av LFA workshop f&#xf6;r att n&#xe5; gemensam syn bland alla involverade f&#xf6;r att resultera i ett projektf&#xf6;rslag till Sida.</narrative>
  </description>
